## BUG-01: PBFT needs_view_change() always returns false — consensus deadlock
# Severity: CRITICAL
# Files: consensus/PBFT.hpp:177-178, consensus/PBFT.hpp:239-247
#
# Rounds are keyed by sha256(evidence_json + "|" + target_id) at line 177-178,
# but needs_view_change() looks up by raw evidence_json at line 241.
# The lookup never finds a match, so it always returns false.
# Stalled consensus rounds never trigger view-change. System deadlocks for up to 120s.
#
# Fix: Change needs_view_change() to accept target_id and use the same key:
#   auto round_key = sha256_hex(evidence_json + "|" + target_id);
#   auto it = m_rounds.find(round_key);
# Or iterate all rounds and check timestamps (O(n) but correct).

