## BUG-10: TelemetryExporter doesn't detect partial writes — promotes incomplete JSON
# Severity: MEDIUM
# Files: telemetry/TelemetryExporter.hpp:37-44
#
# write() can return fewer bytes than requested (disk full, signal).
# Code only checks written < 0 (error), not written < payload.length() (partial).
# Proceeds to fsync() and rename(), atomically promoting incomplete JSON.
# Dashboard reads malformed JSON and fails to render.
#
